msgid "Your order #{order_number} has arrived in Australia"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-at-port.php:32
msgid "Landed in Australia"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-at-port.php:33
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your order #{order_number} has arrived at the Australian port. Next it will go through customs clearance, which is a standard step for all imported goods."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-at-port.php:34
msgid "We are getting closer. We will update you again once customs clearance begins."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-customs.php:31
msgid "Your order #{order_number} is going through customs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-customs.php:33
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your order #{order_number} is now with Australian customs and biosecurity for clearance. This usually takes a few business days. Once it is cleared, we will arrange delivery to your address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-customs.php:34
msgid "There is nothing you need to do right now. We will take care of the paperwork."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivered.php:31
msgid "Your order #{order_number} has been delivered"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivered.php:32
msgid "Delivered! Enjoy your new purchase"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivered.php:33
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your order #{order_number} has been delivered. Thank you for choosing {site_title}, we hope you love it.\n"
"\n"
"Would you mind taking a minute to leave us a review? Your feedback helps other Australians choose with confidence and means a great deal to our team."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivered.php:34
msgid "If anything is not quite right, just reply to this email and we will sort it out."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivery.php:31
msgid "Your order #{order_number} is out for delivery"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivery.php:32
msgid "Your order is almost there"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivery.php:33
msgid ""
"Great news, {customer_first_name}! Your order #{order_number} is out for delivery to:\n"
"\n"
"{shipping_address}\n"
"\n"
"Please remember this is a large, heavy item. Someone will need to be available at the delivery address to receive it, and a clear path for unloading makes the driver's job much easier. If no one can be there, please reply to this email as soon as possible so we can make other arrangements."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-delivery.php:34
msgid "Thank you for shopping with {site_title}."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-factory.php:31
msgid "Your order #{order_number} has finished production"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-factory.php:32
msgid "Production complete"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-factory.php:33
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your order #{order_number} has finished production and passed its checks at the factory. It is now being prepared for transport to our freight forwarder's warehouse, ready for shipping to Australia."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-factory.php:34
msgid "We will be in touch again once it reaches the warehouse."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-on-ship.php:31
msgid "Your order #{order_number} is on its way to Australia"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-on-ship.php:32
msgid "Your order is at sea"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-on-ship.php:33
msgid ""
"Exciting news, {customer_first_name}! Your order #{order_number} is now on board the ship and sailing to Australia.\n"
"\n"
"Sea freight takes a little while, but we will let you know as soon as it reaches port. Current estimated delivery: {eta}."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-on-ship.php:34
msgid "Thank you for your patience while your order makes its way across the ocean."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-production.php:31
msgid "Your order #{order_number} is now in production"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-production.php:32
msgid "Your order is being made"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-production.php:33
msgid ""
"Good news, {customer_first_name}! Your order #{order_number} is now in production at the factory.\n"
"\n"
"Our team is keeping a close eye on progress and we will let you know as soon as it is finished and ready to leave the factory."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-production.php:34
msgid "Thanks again for your patience. Good things take a little time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-unpaid.php:31
msgid "We have received your order #{order_number}"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-unpaid.php:32
msgid "Thanks for your order, {customer_first_name}"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-unpaid.php:33
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for choosing {site_title}. We have received your order #{order_number} for {product_names} and we are now arranging production with our manufacturing partner.\n"
"\n"
"Your order is made to order and shipped by sea to Australia, so the full journey takes a number of weeks. We will email you at every step along the way, so you always know exactly where it is."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-unpaid.php:34
msgid "If you have any questions, simply reply to this email and we will be happy to help."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-warehouse.php:31
msgid "Your order #{order_number} is at the shipping warehouse"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-warehouse.php:32
msgid "Ready to ship"
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-warehouse.php:33
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_first_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your order #{order_number} has arrived safely at our freight forwarder's warehouse. It is being packed and booked onto the next available sailing to Australia."
msgstr ""

#: includes/emails/class-shilpi-os-email-stage-warehouse.php:34
msgid "We will let you know as soon as it is on board."
msgstr ""

